
  db_audit_gm -- Grafana node (dashboards and alerting)

  Provisioning:   /etc/grafana/provisioning/  (data source, dashboards, alert rules)
                    datasources/datasources.yaml
                    dashboards/dashboards.yaml, node-health.json, postgresql.json
                    alerting/alert-rules.yaml
  Grafana:        http://localhost:3000/grafana/
                  from your browser: the bastion's web front, /grafana/
                  (user admin, the tools password)
  Apply changes:  sudo gm-reload-grafana   reload the provisioning files
  Check:          sudo gm-validate         public validator

  DO NOT TAMPER with Grafana's users or the administrator's password, SSH,
  sudo, the gm-* wrappers or the validator.
